second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the album \\\"Beyond Measure\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 86, \"text\": \"Beyond Measure (Dynasty album) Beyond Measure is the second studio album from Dynasty.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 87, \"end\": 143, \"text\": \"Facedown Records released the album on January 22, 2013.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 144, \"end\": 173, \"text\": \"Dynasty worked with Andrew P.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 174, \"end\": 213, \"text\": \"Glover in the production of this album.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 214, \"end\": 264, \"text\": \"Awarding the album three and a half stars, Tony D.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 265, \"end\": 372, \"text\": \"Bryant from \\\"HM Magazine\\\" stated, \\\"\\\"Beyond Measure\\\" is full of adrenaline-pumping lyrics and circle pits...\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 373, \"end\": 459, \"text\": \"with guitars, drums and vocals all blending to a hard, fast and full-of-emotion album.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 460, \"end\": 517, \"text\": \"There is no sitting still while listening to this album.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"start\": 518, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"Mark Sherwood, rating the album a seven out of ten for Cross Rhythms, wrote, \\\"A tad repetitive\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 110, \"text\": \"Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License ; additional terms may apply .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d01\", \"start\": 111, \"end\": 182, \"text\": \"By using this site , you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d01\", \"start\": 183, \"end\": 254, \"text\": \"Wikipedia® is a registered trademark of the Wikimedia Foundation , Inc.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d01\", \"start\": 255, \"end\": 284, \"text\": \", a non-profit organization .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d01\", \"start\": 285, \"end\": 512, \"text\": \"Privacy policy About Wikipedia Disclaimers Contact Wikipedia Code of Conduct Developers Statistics Cookie statement Mobile view Search Search Toggle the table of contents Beyond Measure ( Dynasty album ) Add languages Add topic\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 567, \"text\": \"Page information Concept URI Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Create a book Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikidata album by Metallica edit Language Label Description Also known as default for all languages No label defined – English Beyond Measure album by Metallica Statements instance of album 0 references follows Truer Living with a Youthful Vengeance 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project English Wikipedia Wikimedia import URL https : //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d02\", \"start\": 568, \"end\": 704, \"text\": \"title=Beyond_Measure_ ( Metallica_album ) & oldid=836615835 genre Christian hardcore 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project English\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Beyond Measure (Jeremy Camp album) Beyond Measure is the fifth album by Jeremy Camp, released on October 31, 2006.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d03\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 185, \"text\": \"It includes the singles, \\\"Tonight\\\", \\\"What It Means\\\" and \\\"Let It Fade\\\".\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d03\", \"start\": 186, \"end\": 251, \"text\": \"He recorded this album shortly after marrying his wife, Adrienne.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d03\", \"start\": 252, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"On August 15, 2006, Camp released an EP on iTunes, featuring a song from his new album and a song from his wife, Adrienne's new album, along with an interview about their new albums and talk about their tour.\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d03\", \"start\": 461, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"\\\"Tonight\\\", the title song from the EP, is on the new album along with the title song, \\\"Beyond Measure\\\", that\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 146, \"text\": \"Beyond Measure ( Jeremy Camp album ) - Wikipedia Home Random Nearby Log in Settings Donate Now If Wikipedia is useful to you , please give today .\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d04\", \"start\": 147, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"About Wikipedia Disclaimers Search Beyond Measure ( Jeremy Camp album ) Article Talk Language Watch Edit Beyond Measure is the fifth album by Jeremy Camp , released on October 31 , 2006 .\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d04\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 420, \"text\": \"It includes the singles , `` Tonight `` , `` What It Means '' and `` Let It Fade `` .\"}, \"D5S4\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d04\", \"start\": 421, \"end\": 493, \"text\": \"A special edition version of the album was released on March 27 , 2007 .\"}, \"D5S5\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d04\", \"start\": 494, \"end\": 515, \"text\": \"Beyond Measure Studio\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"Beyond Measure\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Dynasty is the artist of the album \\\"Beyond Measure\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Dynasty\", \"quote\": \"Beyond Measure (Dynasty album) Beyond Measure is the second studio album from Dynasty.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0102-0eb499be3273:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"The artist of the album \\\"Beyond Measure\\\" is Metallica.\", \"answer\": \"Metallica\", \"quote\": \"Page information Concept URI Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Create a book Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikidata album by Metallica edit Language Label Description Also known as default for all languages No label defined – English Beyond Measure album by Metallica Statements instance of album 0 references follows Truer Living with a Youthful Vengeance 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project English Wikipedia Wikimedia import URL https : //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php? title=Beyond_Measure_ ( Metallica_album ) & oldid=836615835 genre Christian hardcore 1 reference imported from Wikimedia project E